  "summary": "<p><b>Shell Company Abuse Act</b></p> <p>This bill makes it unlawful to establish or use a corporation, company, or other entity with the intent to conceal an election contribution or donation by a foreign national.</p> <p>A violator is subject to criminal penalties—a fine, a prison term of up to five years, or both.</p>",
